WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
The gripper engages the load-adjustment knob.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The robot increases the current demand from 1 A to 2 A.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Simulated current and stack voltage show the response to the load change.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Separate shutdown run - load removal precedes valve closure.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:50.000
The robot turns the valve handle towards the closed position.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Valve-status feedback indicates closure before gripper release.
